      "lines": [
        "826. 如果：",
        "1) $v=9\\frac{1}{2}$公里/小时，$t=4\\frac{1}{2}$小时；",
        "2) $v=3\\frac{3}{5}$米/分，$t=\\frac{5}{6}$分，",
        "按距离公式$s=vt$，求$s$的值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "827",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "827. 假设$a=\\frac{4}{5}$分米，$b=2\\frac{1}{2}$分米，$c=1\\frac{3}{4}$分米，按长方体",
        "体积公式$v=abc$，求$v$的值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "828",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "828. 一立方分米铁的质量等于$7\\frac{4}{5}$公斤，求体积为$3\\frac{1}{3}$立方",
        "分米的铁制零件的质量."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "829",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "829. 菜市场运来$8\\frac{3}{4}$吨土豆. 第一天售出全部土豆的$\\frac{3}{5}$，第",
        "二天售出第一天销售量的$\\frac{1}{2}$. 第二天售出几吨土豆？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "830",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "830. 作三角形$MPK$，过$MK$和$MP$两边中点引直线$x$. 作",
        "三角形$MPK$的关于直线$x$的对称图形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "831",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "831. 已知直线$k$和线外一点$P$. 作直线$k$的关于点$P$的对",
        "称图形."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "832",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "832. 取点$M$，过点$M$作两条直线$x$和$y$，使其夹角等于62°.",
        "1) 作直线$x$的关于直线$y$的对称图形；",
        "2) 作直线$y$的关于直线$x$的对称图形."
      ]
    },
